{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"fangji-e-1df7849e05523f5858da","title":"钟繇与人书论朱建平相术及拟嫁荀攸妾","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-1df7849e05523f5858da","label":"正文","text":"钟繇与人书论朱建平相术及拟嫁荀攸妾","evidence":["fangji-q-c13cc61e90cf40cee76a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0181","role":"致书者","evidence":["fangji-q-c13cc61e90cf40cee76a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["fangji-q-c13cc61e90cf40cee76a"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-c13cc61e90cf40cee76a","order":5959}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0181","name":"钟繇","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-c13cc61e90cf40cee76a","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-6a27442282ea3603b9c9","layer":"original","quote":"初，颍川荀攸、钟繇相与亲善〖5〗。攸先亡，子幼。繇经纪其门户〖6〗，欲嫁其妾；与人书曰：“吾与公达曾共使朱建平相〖7〗，建平曰：‘荀君虽少〖8〗，然当以后事付钟君。’吾时啁之曰〖9〗：‘惟当嫁卿阿骛耳〖10〗！’何意此子竟早陨没，戏言遂验乎！今欲嫁阿骛，使得善处〖11〗；追思建平之妙，虽唐举、许负何以复加也〖12〗！”","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
